From 91155796e8e1fbcb5f1d6d694f9392c78dd035ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Wilkin <ilintar@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 22:00:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] hip: add retained PM4 graph command lists

Add an opaque ROCr command-list API with separate GFX11 and GFX12 encoders, queue-aware scratch binding, and reference-counted scratch leases. Integrate retained submission into HIP graph replay with fail-closed AQL fallback, lifecycle tests, architecture qualification policy, and measured correctness/performance documentation.
